{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56596","headline":"游云门寺之一 · 德圆","name":"游云门寺之一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晋代云门寺，寻常岂易名。\n难关千峤色，不鎻乱泉声。\n树石烟中老，香镫雪後清。\n伊余来扣寂，猨鸟共忘情。\n（同前书卷四。\n）（按：《游云门寺》二首，其二已收《全唐诗续补遗》卷二十。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"德圆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}